      "content": "## Reference Information\n\n**Operating Pressure:** 90 psig (620 kPa, 6.2 bar)\n\n### Unit Conversions:\n- 1 psig = 6.9 kPa = 0.069 bar\n- 1 inch = 25.4 mm\n- 1 ft (foot) = 0.3048 m\n- 1 scfm = 0.472 nl/s\n\n### Notes:\n- Select pipe size based on your line length and required flow rate\n- Recommended sizes account for acceptable pressure drop in the system\n- Oversizing the pipe reduces pressure drop and energy consumption\n- Undersizing the pipe increases pressure drop and may cause equipment issues"
